Package: librekde-common
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Shared data for the LibreSCRS KDE integration
 Message catalogues and AppStream metadata shared by the plasmoid, the KIO
 worker, the Purpose plugin and the credential window.

Package: librekde-plasmoid
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         librekde-common (= ${source:Version}),
         plasma-workspace,
         qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs,
         liblibrescrs-agentclient-qt5 (>= 5.0)
Recommends: librescrs-agent (>= 5.0)
Description: LibreSCRS smart-card plasmoid for KDE Plasma 6
 A system-tray widget that shows what is on a LibreSCRS-supported card the
 moment it is inserted.

Package: librekde-kio
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         librekde-common (= ${source:Version}),
         liblibrescrs-agentclient-qt5 (>= 5.0)
Description: card:/ KIO worker for the LibreSCRS KDE integration
 Browse the contents of an inserted card from any KIO-aware application.

Package: librekde-purpose
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         librekde-common (= ${source:Version}),
         liblibrescrs-agentclient-qt5 (>= 5.0)
Description: Purpose "Sign" plugin for the LibreSCRS KDE integration
 Adds a Sign action to the KDE share menu, so a document can be signed with a
 card from wherever it is.

Package: librekde-credentials
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         librekde-common (= ${source:Version}),
         liblibrescrs-agentclient-qt5 (>= 5.0)
Description: Credential-management window for LibreSCRS cards
 Change a PIN, unblock one with a PUK, and see how many attempts are left.
